%% Checkout inventory reservation and payment confirmation.
sequenceDiagram
actor Buyer
participant Store
participant Checkout
participant Inventory
participant Payment
participant Order
Buyer->>Store: Checkout
Store->>Checkout: Submit cart
activate Checkout
Checkout->>Inventory: Reserve items
activate Inventory
alt [available]
Inventory-->>Checkout: Reservation
Checkout->>Payment: Authorize
Payment-->>Checkout: Approved
Checkout->>Order: Create order
Order-->>Checkout: Order ID
Checkout-->>Store: Confirmation
else [unavailable]
Inventory-->>Checkout: Out of stock
Checkout-->>Store: Update cart
end
deactivate Inventory
Store-->>Buyer: Result
deactivate Checkout
Note over Checkout,Inventory: Reservation precedes charge
